=== start ===
This is my modular bullet hell system.
Every attack pattern is a ScriptableObject.
Spirals, bursts, spreads, lasers — each one is a reusable asset.
Designers can tweak them without touching code.
Stack them into waves, chain waves into phases.
You get complex encounters from simple building blocks.
Think you can dodge it?
